                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth oluwo gi Yosuwa ka waco ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waci ri Joisiraili ni, “Wiripo yero tindin madongo ma pondo, m'atieko waco riwin luwo bongi Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma janek m'oneki dhano moro je ma k'ogendera kosa ma k'oŋeyo wonyali bedo kenyo, jolabedo riwin kapondo ri jaculi kwor ma remo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go bino dwire i acel kwoŋ tindin madongo me to cungo i dhiot ma waŋkac ma tindi madwoŋ, to tito banja pere ri jodongo ma tindi madwoŋ no; nyaka to jorwako go i tindi madwoŋ, to jomiyo go kabedo, to go bedo gi jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ka jaculi kwor ma remo oriem go, jokibino ketho janek i cinge, rupiri go oneko nyawote ma k'ogendera, m'oyido ongoye gi kwor gine con mere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Janek bino doŋ i tindi madwoŋ no cuka otiek cungo ruwaŋ cokirok ri thumo banja, cuka tho pa jacway ri Were i wi migam madwoŋ ma hongo no; nyaka to janek dok i tindi pere madwoŋ won aka i ot pere won, i tindi madwoŋ m'oyido cango odwire wok'iye kenyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno to joketho gicen Kedes i Galili i piny matendere pa Nafital, kodi Sekem i piny matendere ma Isiraili, kodi Kiriath Arba (meno Hebron) i piny matendere ma Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka wok yuthenge ca ma Yordan yuwok ceŋ ma Yeriko, joketho Beza i thim i piny m'opiele, wok i nono pa Ruben, kodi Ramoth i Giliad, wok i nono pa Gad, kodi Golan i Basan, wok i nono pa Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a tindin madongo m'oketh gicen ri ji je ma Isiraili, kodi ri jokicar ma jobengabenga i dier jo, ma ka ŋatimoro je m'oneki dhano ma k'ogendera wonyali dwire kenyo, ŋey wokiri wotho gi cingi jaculi kwor ma remo, cuka otiek cungo ruwaŋ kacokirok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
